"Inbox_mischiefgoal_halfway_26_body" = "The first Community Goal event is well underway! Sky Kids have already given the Office rooftop krill over 125,000 hugs, and that means we’re halfway to our goal already!\n\nDon’t stop now – if we reach 250,000 tackles from the Office rooftop krill, all players will receive an inbox with a special Commemorative Bobo Candle to celebrate the occasion.\n\nHappy Days of Mischief, and see you (and the krill) in the skies!\n\n~thatgamecompany";
"Inbox_mischiefgoal_success1_26_body" = "Congratulations!\n\nSky Kids everywhere got into the Mischief spirit and succeeded in giving the Office krill over 250,000 hugs! To celebrate, make sure to claim the special Commemorative Bobo Candle attached to this inbox.\n\nWe hope you enjoyed this special Community Goal activity! As always, we’d love to hear your feedback, so please drop by one of our official feedback channels to share your thoughts.\n\nHappy Days of Mischief!\n\n~thatgamecompany";
"Inbox_mischiefgoal_success2_26_body" = "WOW! Congratulations on completing the Community Goal for this year’s Days of Mischief!\n\n\nWe knew Sky Kids would get into the Mischief spirit, but you really amazed us with your enthusiasm for krill hugs. Not only did you get tackled by the Office krill over 250,000 times, but you did it faster than we could have imagined!\n\nTo celebrate, make sure to claim the special Commemorative Bobo Candle attached to this inbox.\n\nWe hope you enjoyed this special Community Goal activity! As always, we’d love to hear your feedback, so please drop by one of our official feedback channels to share your thoughts.\n\nHappy Days of Mischief!\n\n~thatgamecompany";
